.Sh HISTORY
The
.Xr EVP_MD_CTX_create 3
and
.Xr EVP_MD_CTX_destroy 3
functions were renamed to
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_new
and
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_free
in OpenSSL 1.1.0, respectively.
.Pp
The link between digests and signing algorithms was fixed in OpenSSL 1.0
and later, so now
.Xr EVP_sha1 3
can be used with RSA and DSA.
.Pp
The
.Xr EVP_dss1 3
function was removed in OpenSSL 1.1.0.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_set_pkey_ctx
function was added in OpenSSL 1.1.1.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_Q_digest ,
.Fn EVP_DigestInit_ex2 ,
.Fn EVP_MD_fetch ,
.Fn EVP_MD_free ,
.Fn EVP_MD_up_ref ,
.Fn EVP_MD_get_params ,
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_set_params ,
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_get_params ,
.Fn EVP_MD_gettable_params ,
.Fn EVP_MD_gettable_ctx_params ,
.Fn EVP_MD_settable_ctx_params ,
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_settable_params
and
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_gettable_params
functions were added in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_MD_type ,
.Fn EVP_MD_nid ,
.Fn EVP_MD_name ,
.Fn EVP_MD_pkey_type ,
.Fn EVP_MD_size ,
.Fn EVP_MD_block_size ,
.Fn EVP_MD_flags ,
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_size ,
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_block_size ,
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_type ,
and
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_md_data
functions were renamed to include
.Qo Li get Qc
or
.Qo Li get0 Qc
in their names in OpenSSL 3.0, respectively.
The old names are kept as non-deprecated alias macros.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_md
function was deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0; use
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_get0_md
instead.
.Xr EVP_MD_CTX_update_fn 3
and
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_set_update_fn
were deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_dup
function was added in OpenSSL 3.1.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_DigestSqueeze
function was added in OpenSSL 3.3.
.Pp
The
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_get_size_ex
and
.Xr EVP_xof 3
functions were added in OpenSSL 3.4. The macros
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_get_size
and
.Dv EVP_MD_CTX_size
were changed in OpenSSL 3.4 to be aliases for
.Fn EVP_MD_CTX_get_size_ex ,
previously they were aliases for EVP_MD_get_size which returned a
constant value.
This is required for XOF digests since they do not have a fixed size.
